===Etymology===
< {{etyl|la}} {{term|eloquens||speaking, having the faculty of speech, eloquent}}, ppr. of {{term|eloqui||to speak out}} < {{term|e||out}} + {{term|loqui||to speak}}.

===Pronunciation===
